\newlabel{tab:objeval}{{6.2}{28}{Objective persona-task funnel, local model \texttt {qwen2.5-coder:3b}, base seed 4046, temperature zero and up to three correction turns. \textbf {The personas are generated phrasings, not people; the pass/fail is machine-judged but the requests are simulated.} The shipped interpreter and self-test judge every row. Mean turns to success was 1.0}{table.caption.6}{}}
